1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirteenth Episode
The Castle of Roses

15
00:02:06,661 --> 00:02:09,016
Today I'm doing nothing
but getting bored!

16
00:02:09,061 --> 00:02:11,416
Prince Sapphire, the
troops are already lined up!

17
00:02:11,461 --> 00:02:14,419
Have you forgotten that at
ten you must review them?

18
00:02:14,461 --> 00:02:16,258
You are already late!

19
00:02:16,501 --> 00:02:19,015
You must fulfill your duty!

20
00:02:19,061 --> 00:02:20,892
Fine behavior!

21
00:02:23,261 --> 00:02:26,094
- Here is a towel for you!
- Hurry up! Make it quick!

22
00:02:30,541 --> 00:02:33,897
Soldiers, attention!

23
00:02:34,341 --> 00:02:36,696
Present arms!

24
00:02:42,141 --> 00:02:44,132
Did you see, Opal? Let's go!

25
00:02:44,381 --> 00:02:46,531
Where are you going, Prince Sapphire?

26
00:02:46,901 --> 00:02:49,734
His Highness is leaving!

27
00:02:50,061 --> 00:02:52,495
Nice move!
We managed to slip away!

28
00:02:56,501 --> 00:02:58,810
Greetings, Your Highness!
Where are you going?

29
00:02:59,021 --> 00:03:01,296
I am by no means obliged
to tell you.

30
00:03:01,341 --> 00:03:03,571
As you wish. I only hope
you don't have in mind...

31
00:03:03,621 --> 00:03:06,613
...to go to the Southern Valley.
- Why can't I go there?

32
00:03:06,661 --> 00:03:08,697
There are often
landslides. It is dangerous.

33
00:03:08,741 --> 00:03:10,493
I'll keep that in mind.

34
00:03:11,741 --> 00:03:13,936
Follow him! And see
if he enters the valley!

35
00:03:13,981 --> 00:03:15,016
I'm going!

36
00:03:22,461 --> 00:03:24,213
Here I am at the crossroads!

37
00:03:24,341 --> 00:03:27,174
Since I love risk, I will go to
the left, into the Southern Valley.

38
00:03:27,221 --> 00:03:28,813
Go, Opal!

39
00:03:31,581 --> 00:03:34,220
So many roses...! Who could
have thrown them on the ground?

40
00:03:39,141 --> 00:03:42,019
It's an interesting place, I don't
see any threat of landslides.

41
00:03:42,061 --> 00:03:44,894
I wonder why Geralamon
wanted to warn me..!

42
00:03:48,461 --> 00:03:51,419
Magnificent, that castle
overlooking the whole valley!

43
00:03:57,141 --> 00:03:58,893
Let's go, Opal!

44
00:04:07,101 --> 00:04:10,059
Oh, no! What are you doing, you idiots?!
Put the tent back up!

45
00:04:10,101 --> 00:04:13,013
Yes, Commander!
Raise the tent!

46
00:04:19,901 --> 00:04:22,699
Thank goodness he had already passed,
otherwise...

47
00:04:25,061 --> 00:04:27,655
How wonderful! Let's go in! Do you want to, Opal?

48
00:04:28,781 --> 00:04:30,817
What's wrong, little horse?

49
00:04:35,421 --> 00:04:37,571
What's the matter? Don't you want to go in?

50
00:04:37,621 --> 00:04:40,931
Easy! Come on, easy!
This is no time to act up!

51
00:04:42,461 --> 00:04:45,180
What is it?
It's only an old castle!

52
00:04:45,341 --> 00:04:49,380
It's nothing special!
Easy! What's wrong, Opal?

53
00:05:07,701 --> 00:05:10,852
- And who are you?
- Your name is Sapphire, right?

54
00:05:10,901 --> 00:05:12,892
Yes, indeed! And I am a Prince!

55
00:05:12,941 --> 00:05:15,535
- You are a real Prince?!
- Yes, exactly!

56
00:05:15,581 --> 00:05:17,492
And tell me, who are you?

57
00:05:21,261 --> 00:05:24,333
Perhaps we will meet again, Prince.
Now please excuse me.

58
00:05:25,701 --> 00:05:29,091
Wait, don't go away!
At least tell me your name!

59
00:05:33,781 --> 00:05:36,056
How strange.
It seemed as if she vanished!

60
00:05:37,421 --> 00:05:39,571
I smell a wonderful scent of roses

61
00:06:12,061 --> 00:06:14,097
No passing!

62
00:06:30,740 --> 00:06:32,572
Who could that be? Better go see!

63
00:06:32,900 --> 00:06:36,018
How did he manage to get in?
Come forward!

64
00:06:39,340 --> 00:06:42,412
I have come to fetch you, Your Highness,
to take you to the castle of the roses.

65
00:06:42,460 --> 00:06:44,816
What a magnificent name for a castle!

66
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:03,017
I smell again
that strange scent!

67
00:07:22,740 --> 00:07:25,255
The carriage is heading
to the Valley of the South.

68
00:07:38,220 --> 00:07:40,815
I am curious to see
where we will end up.

69
00:07:57,100 --> 00:07:59,331
You may step down, Your
Highness. We have arrived.

70
00:08:00,260 --> 00:08:02,013
It's enchanting!

71
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:11,298
I'll ask where I am and...

72
00:08:11,740 --> 00:08:13,618
The carriage has disappeared!

73
00:08:13,660 --> 00:08:16,016
How could it have
managed to leave so quickly?

74
00:08:18,660 --> 00:08:20,652
Someone wants me to enter.

75
00:08:21,220 --> 00:08:23,098
What a strange place...

76
00:08:25,140 --> 00:08:26,813
What beautiful statues!

77
00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:33,735
I wonder why those two roses...

78
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:36,692
And now, how do I get in?

79
00:08:46,861 --> 00:08:50,012
And these other two?
How big they are!

80
00:08:50,061 --> 00:08:53,337
Rather, they look like
rose-shaped boats.

81
00:08:57,461 --> 00:08:59,292
Prince Sapphire!

82
00:08:59,741 --> 00:09:02,813
- Please get onto the boat
of the white rose. - All right.

83
00:09:37,341 --> 00:09:39,377
And what will happen now?

84
00:09:47,261 --> 00:09:50,173
- Welcome, Your Highness.
- Ah, it's you!

85
00:09:51,181 --> 00:09:53,012
I am the Duke of the White Roses.

86
00:09:53,061 --> 00:09:55,814
May I ask you why
you had me come here?

87
00:09:55,861 --> 00:09:57,817
I will explain it to you right away, Prince.

88
00:09:57,861 --> 00:10:00,898
It seems that, centuries ago, my ancestors
built the home you see.

89
00:10:01,141 --> 00:10:03,496
The people of my lineage
have always lived here,

90
00:10:03,541 --> 00:10:05,259
one generation after another.

91
00:10:05,461 --> 00:10:07,417
But for some time now,
someone has been trying...

92
00:10:07,461 --> 00:10:09,497
...to drive me
and my family away.

93
00:10:10,101 --> 00:10:12,820
I beg you, Prince Sapphire,
give us a hand!

94
00:10:12,861 --> 00:10:14,817
Please try to help us!

95
00:10:14,861 --> 00:10:17,500
We do not want to abandon
our ancient home.

96
00:10:17,701 --> 00:10:20,534
Unfortunately, we could not live
anywhere else.

97
00:10:20,581 --> 00:10:24,415
Who could this unworthy person be
who is trying to drive you away?

98
00:10:24,661 --> 00:10:27,175
- It is Grand Duke Geralamon.
- Geralamon?!

99
00:10:27,501 --> 00:10:29,492
Promise me your help!

100
00:10:29,541 --> 00:10:33,170
Come on, take courage!
Damned Grand Duke..!

101
00:10:33,821 --> 00:10:35,891
Alright, I promise you!

102
00:10:44,621 --> 00:10:47,772
Listen, brother: I don't
trust this Prince very much!

103
00:10:47,821 --> 00:10:49,812
You could be
more polite, little brother.

104
00:10:49,861 --> 00:10:52,170
Please, excuse my brother,
the Duke of the Red Roses.

105
00:10:52,221 --> 00:10:54,815
I have thought about our
problem. As for me, I am tired...

106
00:10:54,861 --> 00:10:57,898
...of living in this land, where
nothing but weeds grow!

107
00:10:57,941 --> 00:11:00,739
Therefore I propose to leave
it to Grand Duke Geralamon!

108
00:11:00,781 --> 00:11:02,817
Would you dare betray
the memory of your ancestors..

109
00:11:02,861 --> 00:11:04,658
...and the land that gave you
birth?!

110
00:11:04,701 --> 00:11:06,817
Say what you want,
but I don't care at all!

111
00:11:06,861 --> 00:11:09,216
I have already decided to give
this land to the Grand Duke!

112
00:11:09,261 --> 00:11:12,139
We will go where there
won't be all these weeds...

113
00:11:12,181 --> 00:11:14,741
...and we'll be better off!
- You are a wretch, brother!

114
00:11:14,901 --> 00:11:17,096
Stop fighting!
You are brothers!

115
00:11:17,141 --> 00:11:20,053
Your Highness, you had better not
stick your nose into our business,

116
00:11:20,101 --> 00:11:22,092
or we will spread
your secret around!

117
00:11:22,141 --> 00:11:24,018
My secret?

118
00:11:24,061 --> 00:11:26,734
Brother, it is truly despicable
to reveal other people's secrets!

119
00:11:26,781 --> 00:11:30,012
I don't care! After all, you too
know the Prince's secret!

120
00:11:30,061 --> 00:11:33,736
We have the power to discover
all the secrets of human beings!

121
00:11:34,021 --> 00:11:36,216
What secret are you talking about?

122
00:11:36,261 --> 00:11:38,013
That you are a girl!

123
00:11:40,501 --> 00:11:42,856
Even if you are my brother,
I cannot tolerate...

124
00:11:42,901 --> 00:11:45,369
...that in front of me
anyone behaves like a scoundrel!

125
00:11:45,581 --> 00:11:47,299
On guard!

126
00:11:48,021 --> 00:11:49,613
How dare you?!

127
00:11:51,901 --> 00:11:53,619
Take this!

128
00:12:00,701 --> 00:12:02,737
- Will you stop it?!
- What happened?

129
00:12:07,741 --> 00:12:09,459
Quickly, Prince! Escape!

130
00:12:09,501 --> 00:12:11,492
Hornets, sting Sapphire!

131
00:12:14,781 --> 00:12:16,658
Go away, Prince!

132
00:12:18,021 --> 00:12:19,739
Sting, hornets!

133
00:12:28,221 --> 00:12:29,939
That'll teach you!

134
00:12:38,861 --> 00:12:41,421
- Prince Sapphire!
- Let that be a lesson to him!

135
00:12:44,501 --> 00:12:46,298
I will heal you, Prince.

136
00:13:05,461 --> 00:13:07,213
How strange...!

137
00:13:09,821 --> 00:13:12,494
Perhaps...
Perhaps it was all a dream.

138
00:13:13,061 --> 00:13:15,416
I beg you, try to help us!

139
00:13:16,821 --> 00:13:18,413
But then...!

140
00:13:56,501 --> 00:13:59,891
Magnificent! The range of our
weapons from this fortress is excellent!

141
00:14:00,101 --> 00:14:02,012
If this fortification
is added to the rest,

142
00:14:02,061 --> 00:14:04,655
It will be easy for us
to destroy the neighboring country.

143
00:14:05,781 --> 00:14:08,693
So, finally, we can lay
our hands on this rich territory

144
00:14:08,741 --> 00:14:10,572
...that borders ours!

145
00:14:11,821 --> 00:14:13,812
Prince Sapphire is coming!

146
00:14:13,861 --> 00:14:16,136
What?! Put up the tent!

147
00:14:16,181 --> 00:14:19,253
Put the cannon away!
Hurry up with the operation!

148
00:14:19,301 --> 00:14:23,135
Quick! Operation camouflage!
We mustn't be seen!

149
00:14:23,421 --> 00:14:25,013
Away, quickly!

150
00:14:39,541 --> 00:14:42,009
Move! Out with the cannons!

151
00:14:46,141 --> 00:14:47,893
Close the gun ports!

152
00:14:49,221 --> 00:14:51,018
Hurry up!

153
00:14:54,901 --> 00:14:57,369
I do not like running
on the gun carriage! Stop me!

154
00:14:57,821 --> 00:14:59,379
At your command!

155
00:15:25,541 --> 00:15:27,896
Grand Duke Geralamon!
What are you doing here?

156
00:15:27,941 --> 00:15:31,570
Greetings, Prince! I received word
that there had been a landslide.

157
00:15:36,741 --> 00:15:39,494
It doesn't seem to me that there have been
any landslides.

158
00:15:39,861 --> 00:15:42,614
Tell the truth:
what drove you to come all the way here?

159
00:15:42,741 --> 00:15:45,733
Absolutely nothing special,
Your Highness.

160
00:15:45,781 --> 00:15:49,820
Are you sure? The Duke of the White Roses,
owner of this territory,

161
00:15:49,861 --> 00:15:52,614
told me that you are trying
to take his castle...

162
00:15:52,661 --> 00:15:54,777
...and the annexed Duchy!
- Duke of the White Roses,

163
00:15:54,821 --> 00:15:57,574
his castle..
But what are you talking about, Your Highness?

164
00:15:57,621 --> 00:15:59,896
Don't pretend you know nothing!

165
00:15:59,941 --> 00:16:02,501
Prince, there is no castle
in this valley!

166
00:16:02,541 --> 00:16:05,738
There is only that abandoned castle
on that rocky spur.

167
00:16:05,781 --> 00:16:09,012
Look around: do you see the
castle of this Duke of the Roses?

168
00:16:10,381 --> 00:16:13,020
Perhaps last night
you dreamed it!

169
00:16:13,061 --> 00:16:15,700
Truly strange!
Yet I went inside

170
00:16:17,901 --> 00:16:20,859
Fantastic, Grand Duke!
You always manage to fool him!

171
00:16:23,541 --> 00:16:25,133
Why are you shouting?

172
00:16:25,181 --> 00:16:27,012
They are still working
up there! He will notice!

173
00:16:27,061 --> 00:16:28,813
Idiot!

174
00:16:30,901 --> 00:16:33,654
They are roses! What
are you doing up here?

175
00:16:34,141 --> 00:16:37,019
The weapons for the
fortification, Your Highness.

176
00:16:37,061 --> 00:16:38,494
What?

177
00:16:38,701 --> 00:16:41,135
Is that so? A fortification?

178
00:16:41,181 --> 00:16:44,253
Then Geralamon is preparing an
attack on the neighboring country!

179
00:16:44,301 --> 00:16:46,815
I order you to stop and
not to cut the flowers!

180
00:16:46,861 --> 00:16:49,455
You must not ruin this
country to prepare for war!

181
00:16:49,501 --> 00:16:51,253
I will not allow you to do it!

182
00:16:51,301 --> 00:16:53,337
Sapphire prefers flowers
to war! That damn fool!

183
00:16:57,301 --> 00:16:59,417
The tower is collapsing!

184
00:17:16,221 --> 00:17:17,893
Damn it!

185
00:17:23,021 --> 00:17:24,898
But this is a landslide!

186
00:17:58,581 --> 00:18:00,617
Welcome back among us, Prince.

187
00:18:01,141 --> 00:18:03,416
If you look around,
you will see my companions..

188
00:18:03,461 --> 00:18:05,213
...defeated by the Grand Duke.

189
00:18:05,901 --> 00:18:07,619
By Geralamon?

190
00:18:10,661 --> 00:18:13,573
Why are you pouring water
on their wounds?

191
00:18:13,621 --> 00:18:15,418
Water is the best medicine

192
00:18:15,901 --> 00:18:18,017
What? Water, a medicine?!

193
00:18:29,341 --> 00:18:31,809
My friend! Poor little flower!

194
00:18:36,061 --> 00:18:39,451
I understand! So you are
the spirits of the flowers!

195
00:18:39,781 --> 00:18:42,614
Yes, we are the spirits of the flowers
of the Southern Valley.

196
00:18:42,661 --> 00:18:45,016
I am the spirit
of the white rose.

197
00:18:45,101 --> 00:18:47,137
My followers are weeds.

198
00:18:47,261 --> 00:18:50,014
We have taken on human form
to speak with you.

199
00:18:50,221 --> 00:18:53,418
Thousands of us are trampled
every day by Grand Duke Geralamon,

200
00:18:53,461 --> 00:18:55,816
who has the absurd ambition
to wage war.

201
00:18:58,581 --> 00:19:01,015
Poor flower,
what they have reduced you to!

202
00:19:01,541 --> 00:19:05,250
Rally your friends!
We will defeat Geralamon!

203
00:19:07,181 --> 00:19:12,335
Prince Sapphire! I don't care
if the weeds have to die!

204
00:19:12,621 --> 00:19:14,498
Will you shut up?!

205
00:19:14,541 --> 00:19:16,497
I, spirit of the red rose,

206
00:19:16,541 --> 00:19:19,180
have decided to settle
in Geralamon's abode.

207
00:19:19,221 --> 00:19:22,019
There, I will enjoy the
peace of his sunny garden.

208
00:19:22,061 --> 00:19:24,780
Don't you care about what
will happen to the others?

209
00:19:24,821 --> 00:19:27,654
If the weeds are destroyed, I
will have more land for myself!

210
00:19:27,701 --> 00:19:29,259
Traitor!

211
00:19:29,301 --> 00:19:31,257
And you are a scoundrel!

212
00:19:38,901 --> 00:19:40,892
Hornets, sting Sapphire!

213
00:19:49,101 --> 00:19:51,661
I can't do it!
They are too fast!

214
00:19:52,381 --> 00:19:54,292
I will try to stay still.

215
00:20:00,821 --> 00:20:03,016
But this hornet is huge!

216
00:20:04,101 --> 00:20:06,092
I won't let myself be overwhelmed!

217
00:20:06,421 --> 00:20:08,093
Damn it!

218
00:20:11,101 --> 00:20:12,739
Take this!

219
00:20:12,901 --> 00:20:15,017
And this! And this!

220
00:20:15,061 --> 00:20:17,336
Grab the carriage, Prince!
Quick!

221
00:20:20,541 --> 00:20:22,179
I can't make it!

222
00:20:23,821 --> 00:20:25,573
I've got you! Hold on!

223
00:20:25,621 --> 00:20:27,691
You couldn't make it
with that monstrous hornet!

224
00:20:50,221 --> 00:20:52,655
The hornet keeps following us!

225
00:20:54,221 --> 00:20:57,019
Stay back, you nasty beast! Go away!

226
00:20:57,221 --> 00:20:59,098
Hit it! I order you!

227
00:21:03,741 --> 00:21:06,653
If you come within my reach,
I'll show you!

228
00:21:51,141 --> 00:21:53,336
Open up, Grand Duke Geralamon!

229
00:21:55,341 --> 00:21:57,093
Duke of the Red Roses?!

230
00:21:57,141 --> 00:21:59,450
Welcome, Prince Sapphire!

231
00:21:59,501 --> 00:22:02,573
This boy was telling me something
...very strange.

232
00:22:02,621 --> 00:22:04,418
It is something that concerns you.

233
00:22:04,461 --> 00:22:07,055
So, he was just telling me
that he is willing...

234
00:22:07,101 --> 00:22:09,740
...to testify in public
that you, Prince,

235
00:22:09,781 --> 00:22:12,454
are a girl!
And you can be sure he will do it,

236
00:22:12,501 --> 00:22:14,890
unless...
What are your conditions?

237
00:22:14,941 --> 00:22:17,011
Since I cannot live
any longer,

238
00:22:17,061 --> 00:22:19,097
I would like you to plant
this rose in your garden,

239
00:22:19,141 --> 00:22:21,177
so that my family
can survive.

240
00:22:21,221 --> 00:22:23,018
What the hell kind of proposal is this?!

241
00:22:23,061 --> 00:22:25,495
I'm starting to believe
that you're mocking me!

242
00:22:25,541 --> 00:22:29,136
You don't know who I am! I am
the brother of the King of Silverland,

243
00:22:29,181 --> 00:22:32,014
as well as Minister of Police!
E dovrei piantare nel mio giardino

244
00:22:32,061 --> 00:22:34,017
..questo misero fiore?!

245
00:22:47,021 --> 00:22:49,091
Dove diavolo è sparito
il mio testimone?

246
00:22:49,141 --> 00:22:52,099
Granduca Geralamon,
ora mi spiegherete della fortezza!

247
00:22:52,781 --> 00:22:54,612
Beh, vi dirò, Principe..

248
00:22:54,661 --> 00:22:57,619
Ho costruito quella fortezza
per difendere la nostra terra,

249
00:22:57,661 --> 00:23:00,129
- cioè il vostro regno.
- Otterrò da mio padre...

250
00:23:00,181 --> 00:23:01,899
..il permesso di distruggerla!

251
00:23:01,941 --> 00:23:03,897
Questa terra
non ha bisogno di fortezze!

252
00:23:08,821 --> 00:23:11,210
Mio caro Duca,
almeno voi state bene!

253
00:23:11,261 --> 00:23:14,014
Of course! Why?
What happened to my brother?

254
00:23:18,421 --> 00:23:20,412
I think I understand.

255
00:23:20,621 --> 00:23:22,737
Do not be sad, my dear Duke.

256
00:23:22,781 --> 00:23:24,897
I will destroy that fortress

257
00:23:25,021 --> 00:23:28,013
From now on, you can live
happily in the Southern Valley.

258
00:23:28,141 --> 00:23:30,894
On behalf of my companions,
I thank you, Your Highness.

259
00:23:32,501 --> 00:23:36,016
The flower spirits and I will never
forget your kindness

260
00:23:38,021 --> 00:23:39,898
Goodbye, Sapphire!

261
00:23:42,661 --> 00:23:44,811
Farewell! And be happy!

